        "body": "@kmiller68 Babel relies on it being syntactically valid to compile decorators, and banning it would break it:\r\n\r\nhttps://babeljs.io/repl#?builtIns=false&code_lz=AIEwpgxgBBA2CGBnRUCCUDeAoKVSQCYpEAXeEgS2gGIAPAbiwF8g&modules=false&sourceType=module&presets=&version=7.24.5&externalPlugins=%40babel%2Fplugin-proposal-decorators%407.24.1",
